:18:27Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nPoor `derive_script_globals_by_name` is all alone in `interface/editors/`.  😢\r\n\r\n<img width=\"872\" height=\"162\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1bea25a-3f1f-4c87-9b93-9295b0bdcab5\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nIt's only used in `SceneTreeDock::attach_script_to_selected`, but all of its fellow scene tree dock editor settings are in `docks/scene_tree/`.\r\nAnd it's been all alone ever since https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116940.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"882\" height=\"456\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9376b186-3ef0-4629-865e-53fdfdcbf63b\" />\r\n\r\nNow they are together and there is no need for the Interface / Editors category! 🥰\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`interface/editors/derive_script_globals_by_name` moved to `docks/scene_tree/derive_script_globals_by_name`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confus